#: zapzap/features/settings/pages/debugging/controller.py:64
msgid ""
"Reports may include the ZapZap version, operating system, installation type, architecture, Python/Qt versions, error details, and sanitized logs.\n"
"\n"
"Never sent: messages, contacts, phone numbers, cookies, WhatsApp session data, conversation content, passwords, or authentication tokens.\n"
"\n"
"ZapZap does not send reports. After review, it copies the report and opens the official GitHub repository rafatosta/zapzap. You need a GitHub account to publish the public issue."
msgstr ""
"Laporan dapat mencakup versi ZapZap, sistem operasi, jenis instalasi, arsitektur, versi Python/Qt, detail kesalahan, dan log yang telah disanitasi.\n"
"\n"
"Tidak pernah dikirim: pesan, kontak, nomor telepon, cookie, data sesi WhatsApp, isi percakapan, kata sandi, atau token autentikasi.\n"
"\n"
"ZapZap tidak mengirim laporan. Setelah ditinjau, laporan disalin dan repositori resmi GitHub rafatosta/zapzap akan dibuka. Anda memerlukan akun GitHub untuk menerbitkan isu publik."

#: zapzap/features/settings/pages/debugging/controller.py:74
msgid "Notify me when a failure occurs?"
msgstr "Beri tahu saya jika terjadi kegagalan?"

#: zapzap/features/settings/pages/debugging/controller.py:76
msgid ""
"ZapZap can prepare a sanitized technical report locally after a serious failure. You will review it on the next startup.\n"
"\n"
"ZapZap never transmits or publishes the report automatically."
msgstr ""
"ZapZap dapat menyiapkan laporan teknis yang telah disanitasi secara lokal setelah kegagalan serius. Anda akan meninjaunya pada saat aplikasi dijalankan berikutnya.\n"
"\n"
"ZapZap tidak pernah mengirimkan atau menerbitkan laporan secara otomatis."

