msgstr "Pulihkan bawaan performa"

#: zapzap/features/settings/pages/performance_experimental/view.py:309
msgid "Restores all performance settings to safe default values."
msgstr "Mengembalikan semua pengaturan performa ke nilai bawaan yang aman."

#: zapzap/features/settings/pages/performance_experimental/controller.py:218
msgid ""
"Defines where the HTTP cache will be stored.\n"
"Disk: faster after restart.\n"
"Memory: faster, but lost on exit.\n"
"No cache: lower disk usage, slower."
msgstr ""
"Menentukan tempat penyimpanan tembolok HTTP.\n"
"Disk: lebih cepat setelah mulai ulang.\n"
"Memori: lebih cepat, tetapi hilang saat keluar.\n"
"Tanpa tembolok: penggunaan disk lebih rendah, lebih lambat."

#: zapzap/features/settings/pages/performance_experimental/controller.py:226
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Maximum HTTP cache size: {maximum} MiB.\n"
"0 MiB uses Chromium's automatic cache management."
msgstr ""
"Ukuran maksimum tembolok HTTP: {maximum} MiB.\n"
"0 MiB menggunakan pengelolaan tembolok otomatis Chromium."

#: zapzap/features/settings/pages/performance_experimental/controller.py:231
msgid ""
"Keeps cookies between restarts.\n"
"Disabling may cause frequent logouts."
msgstr ""
"Menyimpan cookie di antara sesi mulai ulang.\n"
"Menonaktifkannya dapat menyebabkan sering keluar akun."

#: zapzap/features/settings/pages/performance_experimental/controller.py:235
msgid ""
"Runs GPU and rendering in the same process.\n"
"May reduce memory usage, but can cause instability."
msgstr ""
"Menjalankan GPU dan rendering dalam proses yang sama.\n"
"Dapat mengurangi penggunaan memori, tetapi bisa menyebabkan ketidakstabilan."

#: zapzap/features/settings/pages/performance_experimental/controller.py:241
msgid ""
"Disables GPU hardware acceleration.\n"
"Recommended only for old GPUs or problematic drivers."
msgstr ""
"Menonaktifkan akselerasi perangkat keras GPU.\n"
"Hanya disarankan untuk GPU lama atau driver bermasalah."

#: zapzap/features/settings/pages/performance_experimental/controller.py:247
msgid ""
"Automatically honors an unambiguous DRI_PRIME selector on systems with multiple Linux render GPUs. Otherwise, adds --disable-gpu-compositing when one GPU has no connected display.\n"
"\n"
"Disable this only if the automatic workaround causes problems. Restart required."
msgstr ""
"Secara otomatis mengikuti pemilih DRI_PRIME yang jelas pada sistem dengan beberapa GPU render Linux. Jika tidak, menambahkan --disable-gpu-compositing saat salah satu GPU tidak terhubung ke layar.\n"
"\n"
"Nonaktifkan ini hanya jika penanganan otomatis menimbulkan masalah. Perlu mulai ulang."

#: zapzap/features/settings/pages/performance_experimental/controller.py:256
msgid ""
"Disables GPU VSync.\n"
"May reduce latency, but can increase power usage and tearing."
msgstr ""
"Menonaktifkan VSync GPU.\n"
"Dapat mengurangi latensi, tetapi bisa meningkatkan penggunaan daya dan screen tearing."

#: zapzap/features/settings/pages/performance_experimental/controller.py:262
msgid ""
"Forces software rendering.\n"
"Use only in case of graphical issues.\n"
"May significantly reduce performance."
msgstr ""
"Memaksa rendering perangkat lunak.\n"
"Gunakan hanya jika terjadi masalah grafis.\n"
"Dapat menurunkan performa secara signifikan."

#: zapzap/features/settings/pages/performance_experimental/controller.py:269
msgid ""
"Avoids GPU-backed video frame buffers.\n"
"May help with black screens, flickering, and GPU crashes.\n"
"Restart required."
msgstr ""
"Menghindari buffer frame video berbasis GPU.\n"
"Dapat membantu mengatasi layar hitam, berkedip, dan crash GPU.\n"
"Perlu mulai ulang."

#: zapzap/features/settings/pages/performance_experimental/controller.py:276
msgid ""
"Disables zero-copy GPU buffer transfers.\n"
"May improve compatibility with some graphics drivers.\n"
"Restart required."
msgstr ""
"Menonaktifkan transfer buffer GPU zero-copy.\n"
"Dapat meningkatkan kompatibilitas dengan beberapa driver grafis.\n"
"Perlu mulai ulang."

#: zapzap/features/settings/pages/performance_experimental/controller.py:283
msgid ""
"Disables hardware video decoding without disabling all GPU acceleration.\n"
"Use when videos play only audio, appear white or black, flicker, or cause crashes.\n"
"May increase CPU and battery usage. Restart required."
msgstr ""
"Menonaktifkan dekode video perangkat keras tanpa menonaktifkan seluruh akselerasi GPU.\n"
"Gunakan saat video hanya memutar audio, tampak putih atau hitam, berkedip, atau menyebabkan crash.\n"
"Dapat meningkatkan penggunaan CPU dan baterai. Perlu mulai ulang."

#: zapzap/features/settings/pages/performance_experimental/controller.py:292
msgid ""
"Forces the GBM backend on Wayland.\n"
"Known to fix severe typing lag on NVIDIA drivers."
msgstr ""
"Memaksa backend GBM di Wayland.\n"
"Dikenal dapat memperbaiki jeda pengetikan parah pada driver NVIDIA."

#: zapzap/features/settings/pages/performance_experimental/controller.py:298
msgid ""
"Disables the accessibility bus.\n"
"Known to fix typing lag or CPU spikes in QtWebEngine."
msgstr ""
"Menonaktifkan bus aksesibilitas.\n"
"Dikenal dapat memperbaiki jeda pengetikan atau lonjakan CPU di QtWebEngine."

#: zapzap/features/settings/pages/performance_experimental/controller.py:304
msgid ""
"Runs the entire Chromium engine in a single process.\n"
"Reduces memory usage, but may cause crashes.\n"
"Experimental usage."
msgstr ""
"Menjalankan seluruh mesin Chromium dalam satu proses.\n"
"Mengurangi penggunaan memori, tetapi dapat menyebabkan crash.\n"
"Penggunaan eksperimental."

#: zapzap/features/settings/pages/performance_experimental/controller.py:311
msgid ""
"Uses a separate process per site.\n"
"Safer and more stable.\n"
"May increase memory usage."
msgstr ""
"Menggunakan proses terpisah per situs.\n"
"Lebih aman dan stabil.\n"
"Dapat meningkatkan penggunaan memori."

#: zapzap/features/settings/pages/performance_experimental/controller.py:318
msgid ""
"JavaScript (V8) memory limit.\n"
"Automatic is the safest option.\n"
"Higher values allow heavier pages.\n"
"\n"
"Restart required."
msgstr ""
"Batas memori JavaScript (V8).\n"
"Otomatis adalah opsi paling aman.\n"
"Nilai yang lebih tinggi mendukung halaman yang lebih berat.\n"
"\n"
"Perlu mulai ulang."

#: zapzap/features/settings/pages/performance_experimental/controller.py:326
msgid ""
"Enables V8 predictable garbage collection schedule.\n"
"This adds --js-flags=--predictable-gc-schedule and --disable-gpu to QTWEBENGINE_CHROMIUM_FLAGS.\n"
"\n"
"Experimental option. Restart required."
msgstr ""
"Mengaktifkan jadwal garbage collection V8 yang terprediksi.\n"
"Ini menambahkan --js-flags=--predictable-gc-schedule dan --disable-gpu ke QTWEBENGINE_CHROMIUM_FLAGS.\n"
"\n"
"Opsi eksperimental. Perlu mulai ulang."

#: zapzap/features/settings/pages/performance_experimental/controller.py:333
msgid ""
"Enables smooth scrolling animations.\n"
"Disabling may reduce CPU usage."
msgstr ""
"Mengaktifkan animasi gulir halus.\n"
"Menonaktifkannya dapat mengurangi penggunaan CPU."

#: zapzap/features/settings/pages/performance_experimental/controller.py:337
msgid ""
"Allows background tabs to reduce resource usage.\n"
"Disabling keeps timers active, but uses more resources."
msgstr ""
"Memungkinkan tab latar belakang mengurangi penggunaan sumber daya.\n"
"Menonaktifkannya membuat timer tetap aktif, tetapi menggunakan lebih banyak sumber daya."

#: zapzap/features/settings/pages/performance_experimental/controller.py:343
msgid ""
"Disables CSS and JavaScript animations.\n"
"May improve performance on slower machines."
msgstr ""
"Menonaktifkan animasi CSS dan JavaScript.\n"
"Dapat meningkatkan performa pada perangkat yang lebih lambat."

#: zapzap/features/settings/pages/performance_experimental/controller.py:349
msgid ""
"Disables pinch-to-zoom gesture on touchpads.\n"
"Useful if accidental zooming occurs during scrolling."
msgstr ""
"Menonaktifkan gestur cubit untuk zoom pada touchpad.\n"
"Berguna jika sering terjadi zoom tidak sengaja saat menggulir."

#: zapzap/features/settings/pages/performance_experimental/controller.py:355
msgid ""
"Uses Selection.modify() with visual directions for Ctrl+Arrow word navigation.\n"
"This fixes reversed cursor movement in RTL text inside WhatsApp Web message fields.\n"
"\n"
"Restart or reload WhatsApp Web after changing this option."
msgstr ""
"Menggunakan Selection.modify() dengan arah visual untuk navigasi kata Ctrl+Panah.\n"
"Ini memperbaiki arah kursor yang terbalik pada teks RTL di kolom pesan WhatsApp Web.\n"
"\n"
"Mulai ulang atau muat ulang WhatsApp Web setelah mengubah opsi ini."

#: zapzap/features/settings/pages/performance_experimental/controller.py:361
msgid ""
"Restores all performance settings\n"
"to safe default values."
msgstr ""
"Mengembalikan semua pengaturan performa\n"
"ke nilai bawaan yang aman."

